# Allowlist: this repo is public, so ignore everything by default
# and only let through text and finished artwork.
# tools/, drafts/ and art-private/ stay local on purpose.
*
!*/

!.gitignore
!README.md
!LICENSE
!updates/*.md

!art/**/*.png
!art/**/*.gif
!art/**/*.jpg
!art/**/*.webp

# Never publish work-in-progress or source files, even inside art/
**/_raw/
**/_rejected/
**/_old*/
